                <note rend="inline" type="source">812.00/24788: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Chargé in Mexico</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Summerlin</hi>)</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Paraphrase]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1920-11-30T16:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">November 30,
                                1920—4 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>Your telegram no. 458, November 29. Your attendance December 1 at formal ceremony
                    is thought unwise.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Colby</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
